[{"id":"playwright-locator-role","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"Playwright","tags":["Locator","语义定位"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright文档(三)页面元素定位.md","articleTitle":"Playwright文档(三) 页面元素定位","articlePath":"posts/d5972197/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright文档(三)页面元素定位.md","articleTitle":"Playwright文档(三) 页面元素定位","articlePath":"posts/d5972197/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>为什么优先使用 \u003ccode>get_by_role()\u003c/code>？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>它按用户可感知的角色和名称定位元素。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>角色定位更接近真实交互合同，能降低 DOM 重构带来的影响，也能暴露缺少名称或错误角色等语义问题。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"demo-http-404","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"HTTP 基础","tags":["状态码","客户端错误"],"articleKey":"flashcard-demo/index.md","articleTitle":"闪卡插件效果预览","articlePath":"flashcard-demo/index.html","articles":[{"articleKey":"flashcard-demo/index.md","articleTitle":"闪卡插件效果预览","articlePath":"flashcard-demo/index.html"},{"articleKey":"flashcard-reference-demo/index.md","articleTitle":"闪卡跨文章引用预览","articlePath":"flashcard-reference-demo/index.html"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>HTTP 状态码 \u003cstrong>404\u003c/strong> 表示什么？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>服务器找不到请求的资源。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>404 Not Found\u003c/code> 表示服务器找不到请求的资源，常见原因包括 URL 错误、资源已删除或资源已移动。\u003c/p>\n\u003ch3 id=\"参考资料\">\u003ca href=\"#参考资料\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"参考资料\">\u003c/a>参考资料\u003c/h3>\u003cul>\n\u003cli>\u003ca href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/zh-CN/docs/Web/HTTP/Reference/Status/404\">MDN：404 Not Found\u003c/a>\u003c/li>\n\u003c/ul>\n\u003ch3 id=\"进阶阅读\">\u003ca href=\"#进阶阅读\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"进阶阅读\">\u003c/a>进阶阅读\u003c/h3>\u003cul>\n\u003cli>\u003ca href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/zh-CN/docs/Web/HTTP/Reference/Status\">MDN：HTTP 响应状态码\u003c/a>\u003c/li>\n\u003c/ul>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]}]